  "goodToKnow": "Gegnerisch means opposing or of the opponent: die gegnerische Mannschaft, das gegnerische Tor, der gegnerische Anwalt. Der Gegner is an opponent or adversary: ein fairer Gegner, Kriegsgegner (opponent of war). Footballers talk about der Gegner each week; the Erzrivale is the arch-rival, as in Schalke vs. Dortmund in the Revierderby. Synonym: feindlich (hostile), which is stronger."
